# Virtual environments
**/.venv
**/venv
**/env

# Python bytecode and caches
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache

# Secrets — never bake .env into the image
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Git and IDE
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.vscode
**/.idea

# Node / frontend
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist

# Logs and temp
**/*.log
**/tmp

# Docker files
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*.yml